Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NWhat's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:56.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did you get here in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:01:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous, you know!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.58,0:02:01.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.28,0:02:02.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NPleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.65,0:02:05.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Sniper King,\Nthe King of the Snipers.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.55,0:02:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To make a long story short,\NI've come to rescue you.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.53,0:02:09.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're really serious.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.53,0:02:11.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am not alone, of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.33,0:02:14.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your friend Sanji and a\Ncyborg thug named Franky,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.23,0:02:17.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are currently engaged\Nin battle on this train.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.17,0:02:20.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They kept the enemy busy long enough for me to come here.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.37,0:02:22.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Furthermore,\NCaptain Luffy and the rest
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.41,0:02:25.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of the Straw Hats are following\Nclosely on another Sea Train.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.91,0:02:28.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hear he's bringing a small army with him.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.88,0:02:35.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On my way here, I peeked inside the other train cars.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.00,0:02:37.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I believe\Nthe four agents in
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.90,0:02:40.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the car behind us may\Nprove too great a challenge.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.67,0:02:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If possible,\NI would like to escape
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.21,0:02:45.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with you before\NSanji has to face them.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.32,0:02:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come, let's run away together!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.16,0:03:03.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.85,0:03:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.83,0:03:07.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I made all of the\Nnecessary preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.97,0:03:09.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.26,0:03:11.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These Octopu-shoes are for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.09,0:03:12.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you use them on\Nyour hands and feet,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.85,0:03:13.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you can climb through the window
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.85,0:03:16.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and stick to the outer\Npanels of the sea train.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.26,0:03:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quickly put them\Non before they notice.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.75,0:03:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NI won't go.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.98,0:03:21.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.98,0:03:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know why you're doing this.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.92,0:03:28.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you very clearly that I wouldn't see you again.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.23,0:03:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said I would never\Nreturn to the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.88,0:03:38.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The situation has changed.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.38,0:03:40.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They know why you turned yourself in.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.95,0:03:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That Ice gentleman from the\Nshipyard clarified everything.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.16,0:03:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he survived after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.26,0:03:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But still, that doesn't change my mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.79,0:03:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't go with you,\Nno matter what.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.03,0:03:57.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NEnough with that already!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.13,0:03:58.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.01,0:04:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They aren't so weak that\Nyou need to worry about them!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.80,0:04:05.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking,\Naccepting such a stupid deal
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.14,0:04:08.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before talking to\Nthe rest of the crew?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.38,0:04:10.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think they'd\Nbe happy to go on,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.16,0:04:11.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,knowing that\None of their friends
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.93,0:04:14.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,had thrown her\Nlife away for them?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.35,0:04:15.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that they know why you left,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.96,0:04:18.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they'll follow you to the\Ndepths of hell if they have to
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.49,0:04:22.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and they'll bust every skull\Nthey can on the way there!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.44,0:04:23.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.61,0:04:27.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of guy Luffy is!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.08,0:04:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many times do\NI have to tell you this?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.61,0:04:33.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if you think you can save\Nme, I don't want your help!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.08,0:04:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you care how I feel?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.49,0:04:38.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, gimme a break!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.00,0:04:42.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CORGY]\NHey, keep it down in there, you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.44,0:04:45.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.44,0:04:48.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that we're getting\Ncloser to Enies Lobby
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.64,0:04:52.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is that cool exterior of yours\Nfinally starting to melt away?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.95,0:04:54.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, you can cry all you like
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.92,0:04:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but there's no point\Nin lamenting your fate
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.05,0:04:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,after it's already been sealed.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.42,0:05:02.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.55,0:05:04.71,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.75,0:05:07.10,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not the reaction I was expecting.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.10,0:05:09.74,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't put my finger on it,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.77,0:05:12.37,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,but there's something\Ndifferent about her.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.70,0:05:17.60,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's just my imagination?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.64,0:05:20.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said I'm fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.14,0:05:22.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now please, just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.98,0:05:25.05,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This is definitely fishy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.08,0:05:28.68,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is she goofing off at a time like this?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.52,0:05:34.66,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Rabbit Ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.69,0:05:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.32,0:05:41.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd like to welcome you to the\Nwonderful world of Ramen Kenpo!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.52,0:05:45.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is the lamest power-up ever.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.28,0:05:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.69,0:05:48.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.02,0:05:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Kenpo!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.70,0:05:53.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Pork Bone Spank attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.87,0:06:04.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NThat's the same useless punch from before, only bigger.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.64,0:06:08.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go! Have another!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.81,0:06:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I'm stuck in\Nthis stupid thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.49,0:06:25.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.88,0:06:34.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go, go!\NSo, what do you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.54,0:06:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My Ramen Kenpo attacks are\Npretty impressive, aren't they?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.42,0:06:40.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's kind of hard to\Nlook cool when your arm
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.63,0:06:43.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and leg are buried\Nin noodles like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.60,0:06:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now I believe it's\Ntime to pay you back
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.76,0:06:49.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for all those kicks\Nyou gave me earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.33,0:06:59.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you\Ngetting dizzy for, you idiot?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.07,0:07:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were trying to make me woozy
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.10,0:07:04.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,using your freaky eyebrows\Nagain, weren't you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.84,0:07:06.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bad move.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.04,0:07:08.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for that!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.65,0:07:13.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't pull my arm or leg out!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.78,0:07:20.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to\Nfight back like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.45,0:07:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Here comes my Noodle Soul Press!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.02,0:07:33.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Want some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:35.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.97,0:07:37.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...another helping!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.04,0:07:41.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Another helping! Another\Nhelping! Another helping!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.38,0:07:42.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,61)}Another helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WANZE]\NTake that and that\Nand that and that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:46.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and that and that\Nand that and that!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.61,0:07:53.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally, I'm free.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.50,0:07:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.75,0:08:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for\Nunderestimating me, you meanie!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.54,0:08:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one stands a chance against\Nmy mad, mad Ramen Kenpo!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.84,0:08:10.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I attack him, I'm gonna get caught in those noodles again.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.34,0:08:13.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to avoid that stupid suit of his.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.06,0:08:14.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have a taste of this!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.39,0:08:20.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen and Gyoza Combo!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.65,0:08:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Clap-ping!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.10,0:08:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that leaves\Nme only one place
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.72,0:08:33.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,where I can attack\Nthis annoying clown.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.90,0:08:36.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[SANJI]\NEscalope!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.93,0:08:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Beam!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.56,0:08:52.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WANZE]\NGo, go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.50,0:08:55.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I don't have a weak spot!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.70,0:08:58.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I've already figured\Nout your fighting style.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.54,0:09:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every one of your attacks\Nis some form of kicking.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.24,0:09:04.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So if I lock down your\Nlegs, you're finished!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.08,0:09:06.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.56,0:09:08.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sucks to be you, huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.33,0:09:09.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what you do,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.37,0:09:14.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'll still end up\Ngetting stuck in my suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, Mr. Wet Noodle,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.38,0:09:18.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,while we're at it, try\Nthis one on for size!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.84,0:09:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Kenpo!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.21,0:09:22.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Multi-Noodle Spank!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.68,0:09:35.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the heck did you do to my noodles?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.22,0:09:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I turned that hunk of\Npasta fedelini into a platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:46.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.36,0:09:48.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some sort of trick?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.86,0:09:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! You sliced my noodle\Nfists to shreds, you jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.42,0:09:58.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NA chef must fight without using his hands or knives.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.25,0:09:59.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are sacred.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.91,0:10:02.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's always been my policy\Nnot to use them in battle.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.26,0:10:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, since we're in a kitchen
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you're using\Nfood as a weapon.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.72,0:10:12.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That changes things\Na bit, now doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.09,0:10:13.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew you were\Na pain in the butt,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.92,0:10:16.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but that one really\Ntakes the cake!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.20,0:10:19.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Thousand Noodle Whip!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.54,0:10:28.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trying to look cool,\Nyou insolent little punk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:29.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.20,0:10:30.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An amateur cook\Nlike you shouldn't
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.07,0:10:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,even touch my\Nprecious kitchen knives!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You hear me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.41,0:10:36.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are meant for\Ntrained professionals only!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.31,0:10:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.38,0:10:40.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I sincerely apologize for\Nmy insolence in your kitchen.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.65,0:10:43.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm going to let you in\Non a little culinary secret.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.19,0:10:49.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time for a demonstration.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.56,0:10:53.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is how a real chef
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.09,0:10:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,gracefully handles\Nhis kitchen knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.04,0:11:05.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Shave!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.28,0:11:10.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Strong Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.18,0:11:12.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Paper Art.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:19.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[NERO]\NTempest Kick!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.23,0:11:29.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[FRANKY]\NHow about a taste of Fresh Fire?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.72,0:11:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Has this guy lost his mind?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He jumped out over the sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.31,0:11:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[NERO]\NMoon Walk!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.78,0:11:45.62,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NHow in the hell did this freak\Njump back in mid-air like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.28,0:11:49.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[NERO]\NWhy doesn't my Tempest Kick\Nhave any effect on him?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.56,0:11:51.83,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something\Nstrange about his body.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.17,0:11:54.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.67,0:11:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Likewise!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.35,0:12:06.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1374,1053)}What the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.40,0:12:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAre we there yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.70,0:12:11.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhere's Bashing Tom?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.63,0:12:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Puffing Tom!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.83,0:12:15.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, get inside before you catch a cold!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.27,0:12:17.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just changed clothes and you're soaking wet already!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.84,0:12:18.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI don't care.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.94,0:12:21.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's more awesome up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.32,0:12:23.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NFine.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.29,0:12:25.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ZAMBAI]\NNow, Gum-Gum-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:28.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Three Hundred Caliber-Cannon!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.26,0:12:29.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.42,0:12:32.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWould all of you stop screwing around?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.74,0:12:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– We're bored.\N– We're bored.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.31,0:12:40.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then polish your\Nweapons or something!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.21,0:12:42.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.38,0:12:44.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NUh yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.88,0:12:47.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I tried to tell those guys\Nthe same thing earlier,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.28,0:12:48.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but they wouldn't listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:53.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, check it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.26,0:12:55.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a train in front of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.13,0:13:00.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[EVERYONE]\N– It's the Puffing Tom!\N– It's the Puffing Tom!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.54,0:13:05.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NSeems a bit early\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's in my armpit?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.08,0:13:08.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NDammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.78,0:13:10.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen to us now?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.41,0:13:11.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no engine on this car.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.91,0:13:14.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we can do is wait it out.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.55,0:13:15.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.25,0:13:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Another wave!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this storm\Nis still pretty bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.95,0:13:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think someone will come save us?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.48,0:13:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, there's something\Napproaching from behind!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.35,0:13:24.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.02,0:13:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be a rescue ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.69,0:13:27.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.56,0:13:30.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, it looks like it's coming on the railway.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.06,0:13:31.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.74,0:13:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's only one sea\Ntrain in the world
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.68,0:13:34.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and we're on it right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.93,0:13:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NBesides, it's Aqua Laguna.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.53,0:13:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one could make it out of Water Seven in this weather.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.81,0:13:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, if it's not\Na train, then...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.39,0:13:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...what the heck is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.55,0:13:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the Puffing Tom all\Nright but it's just the caboose.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.79,0:13:53.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no engine!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.62,0:13:55.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it doesn't look like it's moving!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.43,0:13:56.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.43,0:13:58.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TILESTONE]\NWhat's going on here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.37,0:14:01.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does this mean it got detached somehow?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.29,0:14:02.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe something happened
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.40,0:14:04.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and Sanji and\NUsopp are on there!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.67,0:14:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MOZU and KIWI]\N– Big Bro Franky, too!\N– Big Bro Franky, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.60,0:14:09.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NWell, I hope not, cause we're\Nabout to crash into 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.98,0:14:11.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Granny, hit the brake!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.80,0:14:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I already told you,\Nnow didn't I?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.74,0:14:15.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't got one!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.72,0:14:18.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:20.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.55,0:14:22.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.18,0:14:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm flying over to see what's up!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.62,0:14:28.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now Gum-Gum Rocket!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.79,0:14:32.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something in the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.83,0:14:39.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.58,0:14:50.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.43,0:14:51.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.26,0:14:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I made it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.43,0:14:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NWho the hell is this weirdo?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.48,0:14:56.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHello?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.40,0:14:58.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you in here?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.67,0:15:02.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or Usopp?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.94,0:15:04.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.82,0:15:07.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.39,0:15:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe over there.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.23,0:15:16.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NWait a sec.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.13,0:15:17.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that face!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.40,0:15:19.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NIt's Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.66,0:15:24.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.58,0:15:32.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.05,0:15:35.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.42,0:15:39.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't hear!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.62,0:15:40.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NB-Bring it on!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.72,0:15:42.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not scared of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.57,0:15:43.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Sanji?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.54,0:15:44.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.20,0:15:45.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know who that is.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.50,0:15:46.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.57,0:15:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's my friend!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.87,0:15:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NSorry, never heard of him!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.88,0:15:51.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.82,0:15:54.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.64,0:15:56.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NShoot him!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.06,0:16:02.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NStraw Hat's coming out!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.55,0:16:08.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're shooting him,\Nand he's saying "no."
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.22,0:16:09.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LULU]\NWell, whatever happened,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.16,0:16:12.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the train cars must\Nbe full of Marines.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.47,0:16:14.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NSo what's the plan, Rope Man?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.57,0:16:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we don't move\Nthose cars outta the way,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.30,0:16:17.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we might get knocked off!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.70,0:16:27.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, it is a\Nsea train after all!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.61,0:16:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NThey're gonna ram right into us!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.89,0:16:30.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NYeah and if they\Ndon't slow down soon,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.87,0:16:33.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we're gonna get\Nsmashed to pieces!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NLet the Franky\NFamily handle this!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.05,0:16:38.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll dismantle 'em\Nbefore they can hit us!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.59,0:16:39.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TILESTONE]\NLet me help!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.58,0:16:41.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna break stuff too!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.45,0:16:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NHear that, men?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.26,0:16:43.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[FAMILY MEN]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.59,0:16:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.49,0:16:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.50,0:16:49.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hear that, Roronoa?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.72,0:16:51.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's calling for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.52,0:16:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.45,0:16:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.79,0:16:57.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.26,0:16:58.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZAMBAI ET AL.]\N– That's it?!\N– That's it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:07.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NStop the train!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.68,0:17:12.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThe ego of the entropic world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shall be rent in twain.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.06,0:17:26.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\t(2145,0,1,\c&H000000&)}Two-Sword Style Sword Draw...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.66,0:17:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Rashomon!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.07,0:18:05.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LULU]\NHey, if you're gonna do\Nsomething crazy like that,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.17,0:18:07.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you gotta warn us first!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.04,0:18:08.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou heard me say\N"cut 'em" didn't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.91,0:18:10.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LULU]\NBut I didn't think he could actually do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.48,0:18:12.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course he could do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.18,0:18:13.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd be dead right\Nnow if he couldn't!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.01,0:18:16.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess that's true
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.05,0:18:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you're gonna\Ngive me a heart attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.48,0:18:22.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got all that power and he's\Nnot even the leader of the crew?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.75,0:18:28.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not done yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.39,0:18:29.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NWhat the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.02,0:18:31.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TILESTONE]\NIt's a Sea King!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.47,0:18:34.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThere's someone waiting on this railway.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.12,0:18:38.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone who can cut\NSea Kings in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:50.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many times do\NI have to tell you this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:53.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NWhat the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.33,0:18:55.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.70,0:18:56.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.89,0:18:58.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NDamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.73,0:19:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.03,0:19:02.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NYou'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was too late.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.36,0:19:08.04,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2148,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}[SANJI]\NHave a safe trip, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.12,0:19:10.46,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2148,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Say hello to the sea kings for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.38,0:19:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must catch the train.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.18,0:19:19.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must rectify my mistake\Nand capture the prisoners
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.02,0:19:23.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before their evil is once\Nagain set upon this world!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.36,0:19:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot allow\Nthe blood and tears
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:29.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of innocent\Ncivilians to be shed!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.93,0:19:32.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show them that\Nthere's justice yet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in this cruel and\Nunforgiving world!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.30,0:19:39.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care if my body\Nis torn to shreds
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,by these raging waves.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.58,0:19:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:42.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter the cost,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.74,0:19:46.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3862,0,1,\c&H000000&)}I'll protect the future of law-abiding citizens everywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.70,0:20:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.77,0:20:26.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.75,0:20:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems there's another sea train!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.88,0:20:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see someone.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.25,0:20:41.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.21,0:20:46.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's a guy out there!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.81,0:20:50.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the Ship-Slasher!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.48,0:20:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[LULU and TILESTONE]\N– That's not good!\N– That's not good!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.19,0:20:54.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NShip what?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.35,0:20:56.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They call him\N"Ship-Slasher" T-Bone.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.56,0:20:57.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's from the Navy.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.85,0:20:59.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His sword cuts\Nthrough pirate ships
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.65,0:21:01.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,like a knife cuts\Nthrough a steak!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.62,0:21:02.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.72,0:21:03.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds awesome.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.96,0:21:07.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NMaybe it'd be awesome if it was somebody else's problem!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.27,0:21:08.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right men, let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.94,0:21:10.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We only get one shot!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.07,0:21:11.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Set your sights on T-Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.97,0:21:12.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.79,0:21:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[EVERYONE]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.04,0:21:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:23.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[FAMILY MEN]\N– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.88,0:21:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.58,0:21:26.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to hold on...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.35,0:21:28.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's gonna cut\NRocketman in half!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.58,0:21:30.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NJeez, there's\Nnothing to worry about!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.72,0:21:32.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro's got this.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.62,0:21:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just watch!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.92,0:21:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm only gonna tell you this one time!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.94,0:21:40.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.63,0:21:44.57,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[T-BONE]\NThere's no other track.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.60,0:21:47.64,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they passed by my men on the way here.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.67,0:21:51.29,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What did those\Nmonsters do to them?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.29,0:21:53.76,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,They must be\NNico Robin's crewmates.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.79,0:21:57.33,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case, that swordsman\Nis the pirate hunter!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.36,0:22:02.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those who defile this path of justice will face my wrath!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.97,0:22:06.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am a proud Captain of the Navy!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.24,0:22:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall not let you pass!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.47,0:22:11.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be it wood or steel, I'll slash your ship in two!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.71,0:22:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good luck with that one.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.85,0:22:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We won't stop 'til\Nwe reach our goal.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.92,0:22:19.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'll cut down anything in our way!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.61,0:22:22.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThis guy is fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En garde!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.79,0:22:38.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[T-BONE]\NI hate crooked swordplay.\NRight Angle Flying Bird.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.17,0:22:42.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ZORO]\NThree-Sword Style Bull Demon!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.03,0:23:07.53,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[T-BONE]\NHe cut right through it!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.94,0:23:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ZORO]\NBold Hooves!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.46,0:23:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He beat T-Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.46,0:23:30.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must've come from\None of the loose cars.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.89,0:23:32.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta hand it to him.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.33,0:23:35.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It takes a lot of guts to\Nkeep going in a storm like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.06,0:23:38.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But still that's not\Nenough to stop us.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.97,0:23:42.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the burden\Nof justice is a heavy one
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.71,0:23:45.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we've got a\Nfew burdens of our own.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.81,0:23:54.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NHurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.27,0:23:55.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain T-Bone is out here!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.84,0:23:56.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He needs our help!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.84,0:23:59.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NWhat if he already got hit by that sea train?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.61,0:24:01.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't even joke\Nabout something like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.72,0:24:03.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you bastard... our\Ncaptain would cut
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.58,0:24:06.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that crappy train in\Ntwo and you know it!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.78,0:24:15.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think it was Sanji?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.31,0:24:16.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NOf course!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.41,0:24:18.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How else do you think those train cars got detached?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.01,0:24:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good strategy, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.28,0:24:22.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you think\Nwe'll catch up soon?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.21,0:24:23.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like it.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.51,0:24:24.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.64,0:24:31.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for a fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.92,0:24:33.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Rocketman!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.85,0:24:36.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna beat up that pigeon guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.60,0:21:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MEN clamoring]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:16:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[gunshot]\N[OFFICIALS clamoring]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.89,0:15:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[EVERYONE panicking]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.93,0:19:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[commotion among MARINES]
